What do you like most about the object?

50
00:04:01,880 --> 00:04:07,500
Do you notice that this structure has a brainstorming idea approach similar to a technique we have learned?

51
00:04:08,260 --> 00:04:10,780
Yes, that is the storytelling technique.

52
00:04:11,440 --> 00:04:18,959
The structure of this technique includes introduction, background information, main events, and feelings.

53
00:04:19,339 --> 00:04:26,640
To be more specific, both the TIDF structure and the storytelling technique use similar guided WH questions.

54
00:04:27,140 --> 00:04:32,100
For example, the time and background information both discuss the time and

55
00:04:32,100 --> 00:04:36,020
how the event started, and how the object was known, and they

56
