57
00:04:42,100 --> 00:04:46,020
The only difference lies in the description compared to the main events.

58
00:04:46,940 --> 00:04:54,080
Description focuses on describing features, while main events focus more on time, order of activities, or events.

59
00:04:54,860 --> 00:05:02,400
Another difference is that the TIDF structure does not necessarily need to follow a time order as the storytelling technique.

60
00:05:02,780 --> 00:05:07,560
You can freely interweave or rearrange the components in a way that seems suitable.

61
